            for value in values:
                index = min(int((value - low) / width), 9)
                counts[index] += 1

        histograms[name] = counts

    if not histograms:
        raise ValueError("table has no numeric columns")

    return histograms
```

Empty columns are skipped; when every value in a column is equal, all its values go in the first bin.

